1
00:00:05,761 --> 00:00:07,461
(All characters, organizations,
and events in this drama are fictitious.)

2
00:00:07,495 --> 00:00:09,328
(Filming followed broadcast guidelines
for minors. Some scenes used AI.)

3
00:00:10,808 --> 00:00:12,875
(Episode 8)

4
00:00:12,901 --> 00:00:16,268
The man you're nice to and take care of,
can't it just be me?

5
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:24,001
You really don't get it, do you?

6
00:00:26,341 --> 00:00:30,108
I'm confessing my feelings right now.

7
00:00:30,467 --> 00:00:34,134
Just look at me.

8
00:00:36,435 --> 00:00:39,635
I think I like you, Gyu Rim.

9
00:00:40,001 --> 00:00:41,335
Now do you get it?

10
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:44,681
If I get selfish, I might hold on
to you and never let go.

11
00:00:46,367 --> 00:00:48,167
So,

12
00:00:48,921 --> 00:00:51,788
unless you want to sink
into the muck with me,

13
00:00:52,021 --> 00:00:54,888
count yourself lucky and run.

14
00:00:55,814 --> 00:00:57,047
No.

15
00:00:59,134 --> 00:01:00,367
I'm not running.

16
00:01:00,861 --> 00:01:02,938
Muck or anywhere else,

17
00:01:03,868 --> 00:01:06,678
I'll go wherever you are,

18
00:01:07,674 --> 00:01:09,474
so don't think about running.

19
00:01:14,435 --> 00:01:15,808
Gyu Rim,

20
00:01:19,668 --> 00:01:21,092
may I hold you?

21
00:01:28,935 --> 00:01:31,235
Why would we ever break up?

22
00:01:31,541 --> 00:01:33,906
That won't happen
as long as you don't leave.

23
00:01:38,268 --> 00:01:39,928
All right.

24
00:01:41,088 --> 00:01:44,288
I spent all day thinking
you'd want to end it...

25
00:01:46,207 --> 00:01:47,774
You didn't answer your phone,

26
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:49,532
you didn't come to work,

27
00:01:49,867 --> 00:01:52,241
I went to your place
thinking you were sick,

28
00:01:52,947 --> 00:01:55,281
and Gyu Min said you'd gone to work.

29
00:01:56,835 --> 00:01:58,801
I thought something had really happened,

30
00:01:58,826 --> 00:02:00,859
and I was on edge all day...

31
00:02:02,935 --> 00:02:04,368
I'm sorry.

32
00:02:04,935 --> 00:02:07,235
I'm sorry for worrying you.

33
00:02:08,735 --> 00:02:10,935
Do you know how scared I was?

34
00:02:17,025 --> 00:02:18,645
Mu Jin.

35
00:02:22,121 --> 00:02:24,787
Why are you acting like a child?
People are watching.

36
00:02:25,967 --> 00:02:28,001
I'm sorry.

37
00:02:46,281 --> 00:02:49,242
- Gyu Rim.
- Yes?

38
00:02:52,535 --> 00:02:55,435
I met Mu Jin with Gyu Min.

39
00:02:57,435 --> 00:02:59,401
I heard you told him you were married.

40
00:03:01,528 --> 00:03:03,794
Gyu Seo, I'll handle it myself,

41
00:03:03,895 --> 00:03:06,095
So I told him that wasn't true.

42
00:03:06,401 --> 00:03:08,968
I corrected it and said you never married.

43
00:03:10,501 --> 00:03:13,068
So stop shutting him out and running away.

44
00:03:13,648 --> 00:03:16,114
He still seems to like you a lot.

45
00:03:16,901 --> 00:03:19,535
If you feel the same, you can start over.

46
00:03:45,367 --> 00:03:47,001
All this time,

47
00:03:49,235 --> 00:03:50,668
I've been truly sorry.

48
00:04:11,301 --> 00:04:13,201
I won't bother you again.

49
00:04:34,568 --> 00:04:36,001
For as long as we live,

50
00:04:40,001 --> 00:04:42,059
let's never see each other again.

51
00:05:05,394 --> 00:05:09,561
About the offer you made last time,
is it still valid?

52
00:05:11,928 --> 00:05:15,128
If you're still hiring,
I'd like to take the job.

53
00:05:16,667 --> 00:05:18,233
As soon as possible.

54
00:05:21,501 --> 00:05:23,168
Something came up.

55
00:05:25,374 --> 00:05:28,939
Yes. Just let me know
when the paperwork is ready.

56
00:05:30,942 --> 00:05:31,942
Thank you.

57
00:05:54,201 --> 00:05:55,741
Yes, I'll wash up and come back.

58
00:05:55,766 --> 00:05:56,966
Almost done.

59
00:06:00,668 --> 00:06:01,837
Honey.

60
00:06:02,535 --> 00:06:06,003
But I'm suddenly craving something spicy.

61
00:06:07,547 --> 00:06:08,914
Really spicy.

62
00:06:09,768 --> 00:06:10,801
Yes.

63
00:06:24,368 --> 00:06:26,640
- You're here.
- Yes. Keep going.

64
00:06:39,673 --> 00:06:42,107
- Is that even a workout?
- Sorry?

65
00:06:43,434 --> 00:06:45,334
I did all my running earlier.

66
00:06:53,921 --> 00:06:55,773
Right, of course.

67
00:07:15,208 --> 00:07:16,708
I'm sorry.

68
00:07:21,701 --> 00:07:23,568
Excuse me. Gyeol!

69
00:07:23,795 --> 00:07:26,074
His name is Han Gyeol.
He's in the first grade...

70
00:07:26,234 --> 00:07:29,088
- Mom.
- Gyeol!

71
00:07:30,068 --> 00:07:31,468
Let me look at you.

72
00:07:33,342 --> 00:07:35,843
Are you all right? Are you hurt?
I heard there was an accident.

73
00:07:35,868 --> 00:07:38,835
I'm fine. Not a scratch.

74
00:07:40,501 --> 00:07:41,868
Mom.

75
00:07:44,988 --> 00:07:46,922
It's just the tension leaving me.

76
00:07:47,134 --> 00:07:49,868
I must have been terrified,
thinking you were hurt.

77
00:07:50,235 --> 00:07:51,768
As long as you're all right,
that's all that matters.

78
00:07:52,435 --> 00:07:55,835
But Heung Sik got badly hurt.

79
00:07:56,035 --> 00:07:57,068
Who?

80
00:07:57,201 --> 00:07:59,068
Cho Heung Sik.

81
00:07:59,114 --> 00:08:00,781
He got hurt because of me.

82
00:08:01,060 --> 00:08:03,894
He shielded me like this.

83
00:08:09,935 --> 00:08:11,001
Gyu Rim.

84
00:08:16,687 --> 00:08:18,420
I'm all right.

85
00:08:18,445 --> 00:08:20,578
It looks bad, but it's nothing serious.

86
00:08:21,101 --> 00:08:23,301
They said it's only a hairline fracture.

87
00:08:23,335 --> 00:08:26,673
It's not just a hairline fracture.

88
00:08:26,698 --> 00:08:29,032
If you strain it even a little,

89
00:08:29,602 --> 00:08:32,275
it could snap clean through.

90
00:08:35,401 --> 00:08:38,206
There's nothing to worry about.

91
00:08:38,335 --> 00:08:39,935
It's really nothing.

92
00:08:39,968 --> 00:08:41,768
It's very much something.

93
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:44,276
Frankly, if you break or injure it now,

94
00:08:44,301 --> 00:08:46,868
you're not at an age
where it heals easily anymore.

95
00:08:47,334 --> 00:08:49,678
It can't hurt to be careful, can it?

96
00:08:53,701 --> 00:08:57,235
That nurse does exaggerate.

97
00:08:57,448 --> 00:08:59,448
Making people worry for nothing...

98
00:08:59,528 --> 00:09:00,894
This doesn't hurt at all...

99
00:09:01,868 --> 00:09:04,727
It doesn't hurt.

100
00:09:05,068 --> 00:09:06,701
It's fine.

101
00:09:07,668 --> 00:09:09,601
How did this happen?

102
00:09:09,791 --> 00:09:13,635
I was passing by and Gyeol was there,

103
00:09:14,253 --> 00:09:16,236
And it just happened that way.

104
00:09:16,261 --> 00:09:19,394
How is my mom supposed to understand
when you put it like that?

105
00:09:20,134 --> 00:09:24,326
I was waiting for Ji Ung
in front of the doughnut shop,

106
00:09:24,822 --> 00:09:27,383
and the shop's sign fell.

107
00:09:27,541 --> 00:09:29,908
I almost got hurt,

108
00:09:29,933 --> 00:09:32,712
but Heung Sik jumped in and saved me.

109
00:09:35,647 --> 00:09:36,847
Heung Sik.

110
00:09:38,035 --> 00:09:40,235
I'm sorry, Heung Sik.

111
00:09:40,701 --> 00:09:44,379
Thanks to you, I wasn't hurt at all.

112
00:09:44,507 --> 00:09:48,570
It's all right.

113
00:09:49,801 --> 00:09:52,235
I truly don't know what to say.

114
00:09:52,994 --> 00:09:56,526
I'm so terribly sorry
and so terribly grateful.

115
00:09:56,914 --> 00:09:59,273
How am I ever going to repay you?

116
00:10:02,494 --> 00:10:04,401
What a sight.

117
00:10:05,114 --> 00:10:07,048
What am I to do with you?

118
00:10:07,354 --> 00:10:12,105
You already get called every name,
a freeloader and a moocher,

119
00:10:12,130 --> 00:10:15,764
and now look at the state of you.

120
00:10:16,801 --> 00:10:18,135
Are you all right?

121
00:10:18,901 --> 00:10:20,301
Su Nam.

122
00:10:20,835 --> 00:10:22,735
Park Su Nam.

123
00:10:23,235 --> 00:10:25,801
What are you two doing here?

124
00:10:26,201 --> 00:10:28,845
Gyeol, didn't you have school?

125
00:10:30,868 --> 00:10:35,201
Heung Sik got hurt because of Gyeol.

126
00:10:35,368 --> 00:10:39,501
What? What did Gyeol do?

127
00:10:39,641 --> 00:10:43,655
A sign fell, and I almost got hurt,

128
00:10:43,907 --> 00:10:46,450
but he saved me.

129
00:10:46,935 --> 00:10:48,454
I'm truly sorry.

130
00:10:49,335 --> 00:10:50,835
So you're telling me,

131
00:10:51,081 --> 00:10:53,770
Gyeol was about to get hurt,

132
00:10:54,188 --> 00:10:56,943
and Heung Sik stepped in,

133
00:10:56,968 --> 00:10:59,435
and ended up like this.

134
00:10:59,868 --> 00:11:01,501
Is that it?

135
00:11:01,801 --> 00:11:04,716
I'm truly sorry.

136
00:11:13,568 --> 00:11:16,370
He did well.

137
00:11:17,148 --> 00:11:19,781
He did exactly what he should have.

138
00:11:21,594 --> 00:11:24,127
I asked the doctor,

139
00:11:24,152 --> 00:11:28,347
and he said it isn't broken,
just a hairline fracture.

140
00:11:29,035 --> 00:11:32,135
You're getting on in years too,

141
00:11:32,168 --> 00:11:35,635
so your bones won't knit together,

142
00:11:35,735 --> 00:11:38,568
and heal as fast as they used to,

143
00:11:38,935 --> 00:11:40,802
but still, you did well.

144
00:11:40,827 --> 00:11:42,287
- That hurts.
- Goodness.

145
00:11:42,935 --> 00:11:44,401
Su Nam.

146
00:11:46,101 --> 00:11:48,179
How do I put it...

147
00:11:49,001 --> 00:11:50,968
Seeing a son who's nearly forty,

148
00:11:51,109 --> 00:11:56,155
wrapped up in bandages like this
isn't a pretty sight,

149
00:11:56,701 --> 00:11:59,893
but it's a hundred times better,

150
00:12:00,001 --> 00:12:02,601
than an eight-year-old
in his place. Isn't it?

151
00:12:07,568 --> 00:12:09,668
Look at the state of you.

152
00:12:09,708 --> 00:12:12,090
I may be smiling, but I'm not, you fool.

153
00:12:12,115 --> 00:12:14,015
I'm all right.

154
00:12:16,242 --> 00:12:20,108
A young man with stamina this pathetic.

155
00:12:20,573 --> 00:12:24,635
Hurry and wash up.
Let's have a meal together.

156
00:12:25,501 --> 00:12:28,171
- A meal?
- Yes. It's been a while.

157
00:12:28,555 --> 00:12:29,910
I don't have an appetite yet.

158
00:12:29,935 --> 00:12:32,672
Since when do you eat by appetite?
You eat when it's mealtime.

159
00:12:33,035 --> 00:12:36,830
- Let's have a meal for once.
- Yes.

160
00:12:37,156 --> 00:12:41,021
Can you still not handle spicy food?

161
00:12:41,635 --> 00:12:44,113
Never mind. Hurry up and come out.

162
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:47,901
Yes.

163
00:12:57,941 --> 00:12:59,141
Han Gyu Rim.

164
00:12:59,166 --> 00:13:01,275
She's the woman Mu Jin was with.

165
00:13:02,368 --> 00:13:03,967
About my age, I think.

166
00:13:07,095 --> 00:13:10,561
She doesn't compare to Seo Hyeon at all.

167
00:13:11,287 --> 00:13:14,287
Of all people, how could he pick
someone so far beneath him...

168
00:13:14,415 --> 00:13:16,748
He's lost his mind.

169
00:13:19,475 --> 00:13:22,408
She's from a dirt-poor family,
single father,

170
00:13:22,568 --> 00:13:26,101
siblings one after another,
and she never even went to college.

171
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:28,221
Who knows what she was up to,

172
00:13:28,258 --> 00:13:31,035
but she couldn't even get into college
when just about anyone can.

173
00:13:48,368 --> 00:13:52,178
- Honey. We're here.
- Yes.

174
00:13:56,081 --> 00:13:57,514
Stop scowling.

175
00:13:57,588 --> 00:13:59,953
- What, are you not happy to be here?
- No.

176
00:14:02,734 --> 00:14:05,367
So the guest you mentioned was Mu Jin?

177
00:14:05,541 --> 00:14:08,175
- Yes.
- Have you been well?

178
00:14:08,968 --> 00:14:11,435
Yes. It's been a long time.

179
00:14:11,935 --> 00:14:13,268
Where's Seo Hyeon?

180
00:14:14,835 --> 00:14:17,241
She worked late and fell asleep
this morning. She said not to wake her.

181
00:14:17,266 --> 00:14:19,301
Did she? Just as well.

182
00:14:20,035 --> 00:14:21,568
That smells good.

183
00:14:21,601 --> 00:14:23,868
The smell is carrying all the way here.

184
00:14:23,973 --> 00:14:25,940
Shall I have a taste?

185
00:14:31,368 --> 00:14:33,930
Did my husband drag you here?

186
00:14:35,001 --> 00:14:36,508
Not at all.

187
00:14:38,994 --> 00:14:41,560
Well, you're here, so enjoy the dinner.

188
00:14:41,585 --> 00:14:43,979
- It's nothing special.
- Yes.

189
00:14:50,001 --> 00:14:51,514
This is spicy.

190
00:14:56,081 --> 00:14:57,281
What are you doing?

191
00:14:57,581 --> 00:14:58,847
Where's Mu Jin?

192
00:14:59,941 --> 00:15:01,907
- He went to wash his hands.
- Did he?

193
00:15:01,932 --> 00:15:04,732
- Honey.
- What?

194
00:15:04,847 --> 00:15:07,475
If you dump in this much
chili powder and fresh chilies,

195
00:15:07,500 --> 00:15:09,666
how is anyone supposed to eat it?

196
00:15:10,135 --> 00:15:11,835
It smells so spicy.

197
00:15:12,001 --> 00:15:16,402
Honey, do we have Vietnamese chilies
instead of these?

198
00:15:17,868 --> 00:15:20,768
Isn't Mu Jin bad with spicy food?

199
00:15:20,908 --> 00:15:22,908
Bad with it, my foot.

200
00:15:23,035 --> 00:15:24,743
When he's served,
he says thank you and eats it.

201
00:15:24,768 --> 00:15:28,617
If he doesn't, I'll pry his mouth open
and shovel it in myself.

202
00:15:28,835 --> 00:15:29,935
Honey.

203
00:15:30,368 --> 00:15:32,035
It's because I'm furious with him.

204
00:15:33,575 --> 00:15:38,141
I won't feel settled until I see him
crying and running at the nose.

205
00:15:38,414 --> 00:15:39,947
Goodness!

206
00:15:39,972 --> 00:15:42,672
Did you bring Mu Jin here
just to torment him?

207
00:15:45,183 --> 00:15:46,943
- Have you lost your mind?
- Why?

208
00:15:46,968 --> 00:15:48,801
How could you put in so many chilies?

209
00:15:48,826 --> 00:15:49,926
- Don't take them out.
- Honey, please.

210
00:15:49,951 --> 00:15:51,735
I said it's fine, so leave them in.

211
00:15:51,768 --> 00:15:54,001
- This isn't right.
- It is.

212
00:15:54,801 --> 00:15:58,269
Compared to the tears Seo Hyeon shed
because of him, this is nothing.

213
00:15:58,347 --> 00:16:00,547
It isn't that spicy.

214
00:16:02,059 --> 00:16:03,640
It's fine. Don't take them out.

215
00:16:04,135 --> 00:16:05,735
Honestly!

216
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:07,160
Leave them. It's fine.

217
00:16:10,094 --> 00:16:11,561
It's fine.

218
00:16:12,001 --> 00:16:15,019
The color looks bad, but it isn't spicy.

219
00:16:15,340 --> 00:16:17,074
It's just got a bit of a kick.

220
00:16:17,668 --> 00:16:19,604
And to get on in the world,

221
00:16:19,628 --> 00:16:21,935
you have to eat whatever you're given,
spicy food included.

222
00:16:22,035 --> 00:16:23,535
You're a chef, aren't you?

223
00:16:24,835 --> 00:16:28,401
Mu Jin, there are plenty
of other dishes. Have these instead.

224
00:16:28,426 --> 00:16:30,602
What are you doing?

225
00:16:30,627 --> 00:16:33,952
- Honey.
- Eat. Someone made this just for you.

226
00:16:34,388 --> 00:16:36,688
What has gotten into you?

227
00:16:37,035 --> 00:16:38,668
What have I done?

228
00:16:38,868 --> 00:16:40,968
It looks delicious.
Thank you for the meal.

229
00:16:40,993 --> 00:16:42,472
- Yes, go on.
- Yes.

230
00:16:52,235 --> 00:16:54,368
- Thank you for the meal.
- Yes, eat up.

231
00:17:01,174 --> 00:17:02,441
I'll get you some milk.

232
00:17:03,148 --> 00:17:06,007
Milk? He's not a child. Right, Mu Jin?

233
00:17:06,035 --> 00:17:07,810
- You don't need milk, do you?
- I don't need milk.

234
00:17:07,835 --> 00:17:09,143
- Right.
- It's perfectly edible.

235
00:17:09,168 --> 00:17:11,235
- Yes, it's fine. Eat up.
- Honestly...

236
00:17:21,367 --> 00:17:24,800
- It's delicious.
- Yes. Have plenty.

237
00:17:27,101 --> 00:17:29,562
Spicy, isn't it? Unbearably spicy?

238
00:17:33,154 --> 00:17:38,538
You do realize I'm punishing you
right now, don't you?

239
00:17:39,435 --> 00:17:41,917
Yes. I'm aware.

240
00:17:42,887 --> 00:17:47,901
Good that you know.
Then clear this plate. Understood?

241
00:17:48,335 --> 00:17:50,068
If I had my way,

242
00:17:50,093 --> 00:17:52,160
I'd feed you a whole truckload,

243
00:17:52,335 --> 00:17:56,535
and it still wouldn't settle the tears
and the pain Seo Hyeon went through.

244
00:17:56,635 --> 00:17:57,835
Eat it all.

245
00:17:58,435 --> 00:18:01,756
Honey. What has gotten into you?

246
00:18:01,781 --> 00:18:02,944
I'm sorry.

247
00:18:13,861 --> 00:18:16,361
Here. Stop eating and drink this.

248
00:18:16,386 --> 00:18:18,848
No. I'm fine.

249
00:18:19,734 --> 00:18:21,067
So stubborn...

250
00:18:21,955 --> 00:18:23,977
Honestly...

251
00:18:28,635 --> 00:18:30,601
Mu Jin, when did you get here?

252
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:31,995
- Hello.
- Seo Hyeon.

253
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:33,087
Did you wake up?

254
00:18:33,328 --> 00:18:34,662
What are you eating?

255
00:18:35,901 --> 00:18:37,235
Why are you eating something that spicy?

256
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:38,527
You can't handle spicy food at all.

257
00:18:42,501 --> 00:18:44,035
It's fine.

258
00:18:44,341 --> 00:18:47,667
- It's good.
- Seo Hyeon, leave him.

259
00:18:48,168 --> 00:18:51,031
- I'm punishing him.
- Dad!

260
00:18:51,193 --> 00:18:53,562
Mu Jin, don't eat it. Stop.

261
00:18:53,587 --> 00:18:56,570
No, it's fine. It's perfectly edible.

262
00:19:01,540 --> 00:19:04,186
It looks spicy. Stop eating.

263
00:19:04,211 --> 00:19:05,878
- Hand it over, now!
- No! Don't eat it!

264
00:19:05,903 --> 00:19:07,337
Seo Hyeon, give it to me!

265
00:19:07,634 --> 00:19:09,504
Mom, why didn't you stop him?

266
00:19:09,781 --> 00:19:10,867
Seo Hyeon.

267
00:19:13,835 --> 00:19:15,235
Seo Hyeon, quickly.

268
00:19:18,688 --> 00:19:19,888
No. The squid!

269
00:19:19,913 --> 00:19:21,543
Seo Hyeon is allergic to squid!

270
00:19:21,568 --> 00:19:22,868
Seo Hyeon, spit it out!

271
00:19:22,901 --> 00:19:24,235
- Seo Hyeon!
- Don't eat it!

272
00:19:24,268 --> 00:19:25,843
- Are you all right?
- Spit it out!

273
00:19:25,868 --> 00:19:26,943
Seo Hyeon.

274
00:19:26,968 --> 00:19:28,443
- Seo Hyeon!
- Seo Hyeon.

275
00:19:28,468 --> 00:19:30,776
- Spit it out, now!
- My phone!

276
00:19:30,801 --> 00:19:32,345
We need to call 911!

277
00:19:32,370 --> 00:19:33,603
Seo Hyeon, breathe. Spit it out!

278
00:19:33,628 --> 00:19:34,935
- I'll call 911.
- Spit it out!

279
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:36,247
Seo Hyeon, breathe.

280
00:19:36,340 --> 00:19:37,868
- What do we do, honey?
- Where's the phone?

281
00:19:38,055 --> 00:19:39,535
- Seo Hyeon!
- Seo Hyeon, breathe!

282
00:19:39,801 --> 00:19:42,135
We're at the hospital. It'll be fine.

283
00:19:44,035 --> 00:19:45,764
What do we do, honey?

284
00:19:51,035 --> 00:19:53,001
Are you sure you're all right
to be discharged?

285
00:19:53,135 --> 00:19:54,968
You should stay a few days, at least.

286
00:19:55,268 --> 00:19:57,435
Why would I be admitted over this?

287
00:19:57,501 --> 00:19:59,980
Even the doctor says I'm fine
and told me to go home.

288
00:20:05,368 --> 00:20:08,026
What is this? Something in my eye?

289
00:20:09,068 --> 00:20:10,835
- Are you all right?
- Yes.

290
00:20:16,165 --> 00:20:17,361
Heung Sik. Look at me.

291
00:20:18,214 --> 00:20:19,847
Look at me.

292
00:20:34,688 --> 00:20:36,155
Better now?

293
00:20:39,935 --> 00:20:42,393
Heung Sik, breathe.

294
00:20:46,121 --> 00:20:47,221
That's better.

295
00:20:49,035 --> 00:20:51,490
If anything is uncomfortable,
tell me. Anything at all.

296
00:20:51,515 --> 00:20:53,215
Nothing is uncomfortable.

297
00:20:55,635 --> 00:20:57,801
Su Nam went down to Jindo a while ago.

298
00:20:57,888 --> 00:20:59,988
She says her friend may not make it.

299
00:21:00,495 --> 00:21:04,215
Right. She did say Bok Dal
was on her last days...

300
00:21:04,748 --> 00:21:06,881
She asked me to look after you
before she left.

301
00:21:07,295 --> 00:21:11,387
She said I should take responsibility
and take good care of you.

302
00:21:11,554 --> 00:21:14,254
My mom, honestly. I'm not a child.

303
00:21:14,761 --> 00:21:18,994
So I told her I'd take responsibility
and not to worry.

304
00:21:19,701 --> 00:21:23,135
You shouldn't throw around
the word responsibility with my mom.

305
00:21:23,381 --> 00:21:27,314
She's getting more shameless these days.
What if she holds you to it for good?

306
00:21:28,535 --> 00:21:30,212
Then I'll take responsibility.

307
00:21:30,935 --> 00:21:33,901
Don't joke about that either.

308
00:21:34,435 --> 00:21:35,833
Does it sound like a joke?

309
00:21:37,868 --> 00:21:39,348
It isn't a joke?

310
00:21:41,694 --> 00:21:43,175
It isn't a joke.

311
00:21:44,641 --> 00:21:47,087
Are you in your right mind?

312
00:21:47,149 --> 00:21:50,209
Don't get carried away just
because I saved Gyeol.

313
00:21:50,234 --> 00:21:52,201
Get a grip.

314
00:22:08,901 --> 00:22:10,401
Sir.

315
00:22:13,501 --> 00:22:14,970
What is it?

316
00:22:15,714 --> 00:22:17,647
You weren't answering your phone...

317
00:22:18,201 --> 00:22:19,762
Your wife is looking for you.

318
00:22:23,268 --> 00:22:26,235
I nearly killed my own daughter, didn't I?

319
00:22:28,001 --> 00:22:29,944
She's past the dangerous stage,

320
00:22:30,041 --> 00:22:33,627
and they say we can relax now,
so please don't worry too much.

321
00:22:34,774 --> 00:22:38,359
How can I call myself a father
and know so little about my daughter?

322
00:22:40,635 --> 00:22:43,342
I knew Seo Hyeon liked you,

323
00:22:44,888 --> 00:22:47,470
but I never knew
she'd throw her life into it.

324
00:22:54,054 --> 00:22:55,454
I'm sorry.

325
00:22:57,181 --> 00:22:59,263
I don't know why I'm like this either.

326
00:23:01,768 --> 00:23:03,747
You don't budge an inch,

327
00:23:03,772 --> 00:23:05,472
Seo Hyeon suffers alone in silence,

328
00:23:05,497 --> 00:23:08,368
and then she says she's emigrating,
and it keeps making my blood boil.

329
00:23:10,395 --> 00:23:12,128
No.

330
00:23:12,461 --> 00:23:14,840
I'm the one who's sorry. And ashamed.

331
00:23:19,421 --> 00:23:21,909
If I were you,
I wouldn't have stopped there.

332
00:23:24,433 --> 00:23:28,792
A man who isn't even remarkable,
putting my precious daughter through that,

333
00:23:29,834 --> 00:23:32,326
I'd have beaten him half to death.

334
00:23:42,248 --> 00:23:43,840
I'm sorry, sir.

335
00:23:44,808 --> 00:23:46,808
What are you sorry for, you fool?

336
00:23:48,148 --> 00:23:49,800
I'm sorry.

337
00:23:54,747 --> 00:23:56,870
Has Yun Hui calmed down?

338
00:23:58,368 --> 00:24:01,001
She seems much better than before.

339
00:24:04,035 --> 00:24:05,891
I think I caused quite a mess.

340
00:24:12,807 --> 00:24:15,776
Sir, please stop getting so worked up.

341
00:24:15,801 --> 00:24:18,001
How am I supposed to stay calm?

342
00:24:18,347 --> 00:24:20,361
What did you tell me
during my consultation?

343
00:24:20,507 --> 00:24:23,307
What did you tell me
when I came in for it?

344
00:24:23,332 --> 00:24:26,765
You said one peel would leave me
smooth as a peeled egg.

345
00:24:27,595 --> 00:24:30,428
The peeled egg was your own phrasing,

346
00:24:30,768 --> 00:24:34,839
If you drink every day, smoke,
and go surfing abroad,

347
00:24:35,001 --> 00:24:37,473
- neglecting your aftercare...
- Enough,

348
00:24:37,498 --> 00:24:40,185
apologize right now and refund my money.

349
00:24:40,210 --> 00:24:42,310
You little con artist.

350
00:24:43,848 --> 00:24:48,314
Did you just call me a con artist?

351
00:24:49,288 --> 00:24:52,621
Have you been drinking, sir?

352
00:24:52,821 --> 00:24:54,129
What?

353
00:24:54,667 --> 00:24:57,667
I'm not a con artist. I'm a doctor.

354
00:24:58,335 --> 00:25:01,026
Apologize while I'm still asking nicely.

355
00:25:01,394 --> 00:25:04,434
Do you know whose son I am?

356
00:25:05,747 --> 00:25:07,983
Didn't the director tell you?

357
00:25:08,820 --> 00:25:12,620
One word from my parents
and someone like you,

358
00:25:12,801 --> 00:25:15,701
is out on the street. Understand?

359
00:25:16,995 --> 00:25:19,061
I've held my tongue long enough,

360
00:25:19,488 --> 00:25:22,656
you ugly little punk!

361
00:25:23,186 --> 00:25:26,527
If you want an apology so badly,

362
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:30,043
go get one from the parents
who gave you that skin,

363
00:25:30,068 --> 00:25:33,401
and if you want to be a peeled egg,
get yourself born again!

364
00:25:33,868 --> 00:25:37,228
Did your mother really celebrate
having a son like you?

365
00:25:37,253 --> 00:25:39,986
What, did she throw a party for you?

366
00:25:40,201 --> 00:25:42,935
(Doctor Han Gyu Yeong)

367
00:26:00,868 --> 00:26:02,735
(Han Gyu O)

368
00:26:03,114 --> 00:26:05,131
Honestly.

369
00:26:13,535 --> 00:26:15,368
Why do you keep calling?

370
00:26:15,393 --> 00:26:17,420
If I don't answer,
assume I'm busy and leave it.

371
00:26:17,561 --> 00:26:19,794
Are you going to keep at it
until I pick up?

372
00:26:19,974 --> 00:26:21,874
Gyu Yeong, why aren't you
keeping your promise?

373
00:26:25,601 --> 00:26:27,435
No matter how busy you are,

374
00:26:27,501 --> 00:26:32,056
you couldn't spare the time
to say two words? "I'm sorry?"

375
00:26:33,068 --> 00:26:37,501
Apologize to your sister properly,

376
00:26:37,535 --> 00:26:39,519
bow your head, and go back home.

377
00:26:40,168 --> 00:26:42,035
If you don't keep your promise,

378
00:26:42,060 --> 00:26:44,600
I won't be keeping my mouth shut,
so act accordingly.

379
00:26:51,226 --> 00:26:52,414
What is this?

380
00:26:52,439 --> 00:26:55,161
Has everyone joined forces
to devour me today?

381
00:27:02,068 --> 00:27:03,949
- She hung up. Take the phone.
- Yes.

382
00:27:06,135 --> 00:27:08,939
Do you have something on Han Gyu Yeong?

383
00:27:09,335 --> 00:27:10,768
What is it?

384
00:27:11,535 --> 00:27:14,006
Shouldn't you be at work?
Is it okay for you to be here with me?

385
00:27:14,368 --> 00:27:16,059
It's fine. I took a week off.

386
00:27:16,135 --> 00:27:18,968
Just treat me like a servant
and put me to work.

387
00:27:20,507 --> 00:27:23,083
I'm just causing trouble for everyone.

388
00:27:23,435 --> 00:27:25,735
Don't give me that.

389
00:27:25,795 --> 00:27:27,343
Heung Sik, you saved Gyeol,

390
00:27:27,368 --> 00:27:29,135
and by saving Gyeol, you saved Gyu Rim.

391
00:27:29,168 --> 00:27:30,835
And by saving Gyu Rim, you saved me too.

392
00:27:30,901 --> 00:27:32,768
You saved my whole family.

393
00:27:33,301 --> 00:27:37,258
Don't make a fuss over nothing.
Go to the kitchen and get me water.

394
00:27:37,701 --> 00:27:38,968
Yes.

395
00:27:40,741 --> 00:27:43,075
So what do you have on Han Gyu Yeong?

396
00:27:43,188 --> 00:27:44,754
Can't you share it with me?

397
00:27:46,515 --> 00:27:49,248
- Public urination?
- Hurry up and bring it!

398
00:27:49,273 --> 00:27:52,340
- I'm dying of thirst.
- Tell me when I bring it.

399
00:27:58,401 --> 00:27:59,927
You really got fired?

400
00:28:01,347 --> 00:28:04,214
They said he was an assemblyman's son
and asked me to take extra care of him,

401
00:28:04,335 --> 00:28:06,835
- but I never heard any of it.
- Well done.

402
00:28:07,401 --> 00:28:09,635
Calling a doctor a con artist, honestly.

403
00:28:09,868 --> 00:28:12,680
We may not have money, but we have pride.

404
00:28:12,741 --> 00:28:14,895
I want power so badly.

405
00:28:15,107 --> 00:28:18,458
I want to die, struck by a pile of money.

406
00:28:19,227 --> 00:28:21,481
It's better this way, honestly.

407
00:28:21,868 --> 00:28:24,701
You always found that job so hard.

408
00:28:27,002 --> 00:28:31,102
My team leader has been asking
to meet you, actually.

409
00:28:33,381 --> 00:28:36,387
- Your team leader?
- I told you before, remember?

410
00:28:36,412 --> 00:28:39,579
The task force got put together
thanks to the idea you gave us.

411
00:28:40,815 --> 00:28:45,648
Since you're this involved already,
come and help us out.

412
00:29:00,814 --> 00:29:04,157
You should say something
before you come out.

413
00:29:04,375 --> 00:29:08,514
Should I announce
"Gyeol is coming out" at the door?

414
00:29:10,635 --> 00:29:11,835
So where are you off to?

415
00:29:12,088 --> 00:29:14,921
There's a new puppy at U Ram's house,
so I'm going to see it.

416
00:29:15,168 --> 00:29:17,468
Who's home? Is your mother back?

417
00:29:17,547 --> 00:29:19,439
No. Only Grandfather.

418
00:29:19,535 --> 00:29:20,910
I'm off.

419
00:29:22,435 --> 00:29:23,668
Han Gyeol.

420
00:29:26,368 --> 00:29:28,435
Listen carefully. Two words.

421
00:29:28,835 --> 00:29:30,505
"I'm sorry."

422
00:29:30,733 --> 00:29:32,835
Tell your mother I said that,

423
00:29:32,835 --> 00:29:35,835
and your mother tells Heung Sik
that I apologized.

424
00:29:35,868 --> 00:29:38,743
A bit complicated?
Shall I explain it again? So...

425
00:29:38,768 --> 00:29:40,768
Why are you making a child do that?

426
00:29:40,994 --> 00:29:42,327
Let go.

427
00:29:44,981 --> 00:29:48,047
Shouldn't you apologize yourself?

428
00:29:49,735 --> 00:29:52,201
You lot are dim and don't even
stay for evening study?

429
00:29:52,354 --> 00:29:54,758
No wonder your grades are what they are.

430
00:29:55,868 --> 00:29:57,168
You've moved back in?

431
00:29:57,315 --> 00:29:59,096
What business is it of yours?

432
00:29:59,121 --> 00:30:00,555
It's my house too.

433
00:30:02,820 --> 00:30:04,487
Gyeol, go inside.

434
00:30:04,814 --> 00:30:06,414
I was on my way out.

435
00:30:06,635 --> 00:30:08,568
Were you? Off you go, then.

436
00:30:08,838 --> 00:30:11,533
- Fighting again?
- We won't fight.

437
00:30:12,054 --> 00:30:15,625
I put in at least 50,000 dollars
when we got this place.

438
00:30:16,035 --> 00:30:18,301
You lot live here without paying a cent,

439
00:30:18,335 --> 00:30:20,485
but I have a claim of at least
50,000 dollars on this house.

440
00:30:20,510 --> 00:30:21,976
Fifty thousand, my foot.

441
00:30:22,161 --> 00:30:24,321
Gyeol is right there. Watch your mouth.

442
00:30:24,702 --> 00:30:28,102
I'm off to U Ram's,
so say what you want now, Gyu Min.

443
00:30:28,127 --> 00:30:29,593
I'm off.

444
00:30:32,661 --> 00:30:35,870
So you two have joined forces?

445
00:30:36,501 --> 00:30:39,835
Fine. I'm the wicked stepsister.
I'm the evil one.

446
00:30:40,468 --> 00:30:41,968
I'm sorry.

447
00:30:43,001 --> 00:30:44,322
I'm truly sorry.

448
00:30:45,935 --> 00:30:47,643
What's this apology out of nowhere?

449
00:30:47,668 --> 00:30:49,434
What are you sorry for?

450
00:30:50,201 --> 00:30:51,735
You're the most annoying one today.

451
00:30:52,168 --> 00:30:53,961
That my mother and our father
had an affair,

452
00:30:55,021 --> 00:30:58,082
and your mother was divorced
and thrown out,

453
00:30:59,367 --> 00:31:01,167
and then, not even three years later,

454
00:31:01,269 --> 00:31:04,298
My mother ran off with
the accounting manager, taking all we had.

455
00:31:04,701 --> 00:31:06,410
and this family fell apart.
I'm sorry for all of it.

456
00:31:06,435 --> 00:31:09,601
Why are you apologizing for that?

457
00:31:10,001 --> 00:31:11,468
That woman is the one at fault.

458
00:31:11,468 --> 00:31:12,868
If anyone should apologize, it's her.

459
00:31:13,228 --> 00:31:15,000
Why should you?

460
00:31:15,568 --> 00:31:17,235
Lower your voice, Han Gyu Min.

461
00:31:18,341 --> 00:31:20,608
Why apologize for something
that isn't your fault?

462
00:31:21,220 --> 00:31:22,253
This is so annoying.

463
00:31:24,754 --> 00:31:26,878
Go on, say it louder.

464
00:31:26,980 --> 00:31:29,733
Shout and fight some more,
so the whole neighborhood knows.

465
00:31:35,535 --> 00:31:38,868
Honestly, every one of them
is shabby and second-rate.

466
00:31:39,751 --> 00:31:43,768
I need to marry fast
and escape this wretched house.

467
00:31:44,648 --> 00:31:46,241
Why are you crying?

468
00:31:58,001 --> 00:32:00,501
Let's go get ice cream. My treat.

469
00:32:00,748 --> 00:32:02,387
- Come on, let's go.
- No.

470
00:32:06,235 --> 00:32:07,835
(500,000 dollars)

471
00:32:15,355 --> 00:32:18,918
Heavens above. Money is my enemy.

472
00:32:19,093 --> 00:32:23,440
Pour a fortune down
upon this poor little lamb.

473
00:32:23,668 --> 00:32:25,447
I don't mind dying struck by it,

474
00:32:25,568 --> 00:32:28,101
so please, just once,

475
00:32:28,568 --> 00:32:32,317
Just once, give me the chance.

476
00:32:33,362 --> 00:32:35,237
Praise be to Buddha.

477
00:32:35,335 --> 00:32:37,101
Hallelujah.

478
00:32:43,528 --> 00:32:45,523
Landmines everywhere.

479
00:32:53,435 --> 00:32:54,501
Dad.

480
00:32:55,596 --> 00:32:56,835
Han Seok Jung.

481
00:33:01,235 --> 00:33:02,468
Can you see me?

482
00:33:04,514 --> 00:33:07,276
I hear I died a few years ago.

483
00:33:08,335 --> 00:33:10,334
Can you see ghosts?

484
00:33:10,868 --> 00:33:12,682
How childish.

485
00:33:15,488 --> 00:33:17,299
There's something I need you to do, Dad.

486
00:33:19,635 --> 00:33:22,576
- Do I look like your father?
- Honestly.

487
00:33:25,562 --> 00:33:27,994
If this lottery ticket ever wins,

488
00:33:28,514 --> 00:33:30,695
I won't give you a single cent.

489
00:33:35,221 --> 00:33:37,693
Let's find Han Gyu Rim a husband.

490
00:33:38,701 --> 00:33:39,735
What?

491
00:33:39,858 --> 00:33:42,560
I don't mean marry her off right away.

492
00:33:42,585 --> 00:33:45,022
I mean, we tell people
Gyeol's father is back.

493
00:33:45,235 --> 00:33:47,368
There's no need to tell the whole town.

494
00:33:47,368 --> 00:33:49,755
We just need to fool Heung Sik and Su Nam.

495
00:33:50,718 --> 00:33:52,314
And who is Gyeol's father?

496
00:33:53,406 --> 00:33:54,568
How should I know?

497
00:33:57,183 --> 00:34:00,529
Did you quit being a doctor
to become a con artist?

498
00:34:02,010 --> 00:34:04,735
- Won't you cooperate?
- I won't.

499
00:34:05,135 --> 00:34:07,043
If you're going to lie,
make it convincing.

500
00:34:07,668 --> 00:34:10,444
That's the only way Heung Sik
gives up and backs off.

501
00:34:10,514 --> 00:34:13,021
Then he'll leave Gyu Rim alone
and stay out of my business.

502
00:34:13,401 --> 00:34:15,801
Or rather, in this family's business.

503
00:34:16,135 --> 00:34:18,035
You don't like Heung Sik either, Dad.

504
00:34:18,368 --> 00:34:19,701
Not a winner.

505
00:34:21,568 --> 00:34:24,735
I've decided to settle down
and live decently, so leave me alone.

506
00:34:29,742 --> 00:34:30,974
Actually,

507
00:34:31,868 --> 00:34:35,643
I'll tell my in-laws
that you're alive again.

508
00:34:37,201 --> 00:34:39,568
Am I some kind of miracle?

509
00:34:40,268 --> 00:34:41,901
Have I risen from the dead?

510
00:34:43,377 --> 00:34:44,814
At my wedding,

511
00:34:46,261 --> 00:34:47,887
please come, Dad.

512
00:34:49,461 --> 00:34:50,494
Gyu Yeong.

513
00:34:51,500 --> 00:34:52,900
Now that I think about it,

514
00:34:54,814 --> 00:34:57,247
I really do need you.

515
00:34:59,568 --> 00:35:01,001
Please save me.

516
00:35:02,253 --> 00:35:06,541
Gyu Yeong, why are you crying?

517
00:35:07,435 --> 00:35:09,466
Why would the great Han Gyu Yeong...

518
00:35:10,122 --> 00:35:13,988
And I'm weak to tears.

519
00:35:15,935 --> 00:35:18,950
Don't cry, sweetheart.

520
00:35:18,975 --> 00:35:21,672
All right, so what should I do for you?

521
00:35:21,941 --> 00:35:23,158
Cooperate.

522
00:35:24,088 --> 00:35:25,648
- Cooperate?
- Yes.

523
00:35:26,976 --> 00:35:28,235
You'll do it, won't you?

524
00:35:31,281 --> 00:35:32,941
I'll have to think about it.

525
00:35:35,768 --> 00:35:39,388
Don't cry, sweetheart.

526
00:35:39,435 --> 00:35:42,088
Don't cry. All right.

527
00:35:42,968 --> 00:35:44,001
Where's Heung Sik?

528
00:35:44,068 --> 00:35:46,037
I was washing his face. All done.

529
00:35:46,527 --> 00:35:48,701
- What's all this?
- Food for you and Heung Sik.

530
00:35:48,701 --> 00:35:50,401
Hungry? I'll get the table ready.

531
00:35:50,480 --> 00:35:51,866
- Take this.
- Yes.

532
00:35:52,664 --> 00:35:55,168
Heung Sik, I'm here.

533
00:35:56,035 --> 00:35:57,819
What are you doing here?

534
00:35:58,094 --> 00:35:59,400
You're dripping.

535
00:36:00,994 --> 00:36:03,901
How did he wash your face?

536
00:36:08,027 --> 00:36:09,950
Breathe.

537
00:36:10,935 --> 00:36:11,935
There.

538
00:36:12,562 --> 00:36:15,301
Gyu Rim, can I go out for a bit?

539
00:36:15,368 --> 00:36:16,435
- Where?
- Where?

540
00:36:16,568 --> 00:36:20,165
I forgot something I have to give
a friend today. Two hours is enough.

541
00:36:20,201 --> 00:36:21,235
- You can't.
- Go ahead.

542
00:36:24,168 --> 00:36:25,968
You're leaving me alone with your sister,

543
00:36:25,968 --> 00:36:27,868
for two whole hours? Absolutely not.

544
00:36:27,868 --> 00:36:29,335
You can't.

545
00:36:32,408 --> 00:36:33,441
You really can't.

546
00:36:37,935 --> 00:36:40,877
Let's eat, Heung Sik.

547
00:36:43,201 --> 00:36:44,235
Hey.

548
00:36:45,935 --> 00:36:48,501
There's a seat over there.
Why sit next to me?

549
00:36:48,501 --> 00:36:50,035
To feed you.

550
00:36:51,768 --> 00:36:53,001
Am I a baby?

551
00:36:53,001 --> 00:36:55,884
You can't use your hands.
Right now you're exactly like one.

552
00:36:56,742 --> 00:36:59,735
Never mind. I'll eat when Gyu O gets back.

553
00:37:00,101 --> 00:37:02,210
How can you wait until Gyu O returns?

554
00:37:02,328 --> 00:37:04,328
After all the effort I put in.

555
00:37:04,935 --> 00:37:06,597
The rice and soup will go cold.

556
00:37:08,174 --> 00:37:09,207
All right.

557
00:37:10,401 --> 00:37:11,401
Here.

558
00:37:16,301 --> 00:37:17,668
Give me the rice.

559
00:37:17,668 --> 00:37:19,301
I can eat on my own.

560
00:37:19,535 --> 00:37:20,535
Here.

561
00:37:20,535 --> 00:37:22,435
You said you liked anchovy wraps,

562
00:37:22,435 --> 00:37:24,368
so I went to the market and bought some.

563
00:37:24,535 --> 00:37:25,735
Doesn't it look delicious?

564
00:37:27,368 --> 00:37:28,968
Let's see what we've got.

565
00:37:31,401 --> 00:37:33,468
Anchovies in,

566
00:37:34,068 --> 00:37:37,462
and rice with it.

567
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:42,870
Just leave it there. I can do it myself.

568
00:37:43,235 --> 00:37:44,943
How could I just leave it there?

569
00:37:44,968 --> 00:37:46,068
Come on, open up.

570
00:37:46,435 --> 00:37:48,324
I'm not eating a wrap you made.

571
00:37:48,435 --> 00:37:50,311
Just leave it on the table.

572
00:37:50,468 --> 00:37:52,906
I washed my hands well, Heung Sik.

573
00:37:54,561 --> 00:37:56,368
What if I eat this,

574
00:37:56,368 --> 00:37:58,568
and have a heart attack?
Will you take responsibility?

575
00:37:58,621 --> 00:38:01,068
Yes. I will.

576
00:38:03,068 --> 00:38:05,201
You're driving me crazy.

577
00:38:05,635 --> 00:38:07,901
I told you not to say
you'd take responsibility.

578
00:38:08,168 --> 00:38:09,401
If my mom hears you,

579
00:38:09,401 --> 00:38:14,079
she'll make you put it in writing
and hold you to it forever!

580
00:38:18,531 --> 00:38:19,768
You know what,

581
00:38:19,768 --> 00:38:21,401
I think I should be by Seo Hyeon's side.

582
00:38:21,401 --> 00:38:22,535
Turn the car around.

583
00:38:22,944 --> 00:38:25,635
No, honey. I'll stay with her.

584
00:38:25,635 --> 00:38:26,868
Jeong Woo, turn around.

585
00:38:26,968 --> 00:38:27,968
Shall we?

586
00:38:28,001 --> 00:38:30,901
We only just managed to sort it out...

587
00:38:30,901 --> 00:38:32,335
Are you two really doing this?

588
00:38:32,901 --> 00:38:35,668
Sorry to be blunt,

589
00:38:35,668 --> 00:38:36,968
but when Seo Hyeon wakes up,

590
00:38:36,993 --> 00:38:39,468
would she rather see you two, or Mu Jin?

591
00:38:40,674 --> 00:38:42,717
What kind of nonsense is that?

592
00:38:43,001 --> 00:38:45,068
We need to be right there
when she wakes up,

593
00:38:45,068 --> 00:38:47,035
so she'll feel safe with us.

594
00:38:47,268 --> 00:38:50,127
Who is Mu Jin? He's an outsider.

595
00:38:50,401 --> 00:38:51,935
And not just any outsider,

596
00:38:52,668 --> 00:38:53,801
he's an awful man.

597
00:38:54,581 --> 00:38:57,439
You know he isn't himself right now.
Filter what he says.

598
00:38:58,901 --> 00:39:01,926
Today was entirely your fault.

599
00:39:02,468 --> 00:39:05,527
You said you'd made peace with Mu Jin,
so why start again?

600
00:39:06,008 --> 00:39:09,272
I was fine until earlier. I don't know.

601
00:39:10,030 --> 00:39:12,910
Just hearing Mu Jin's name
makes the anger rise up in me.

602
00:39:12,935 --> 00:39:14,703
He deserves worse than a beating.

603
00:39:15,201 --> 00:39:17,707
Shall I slip some poison
into that man's food?

604
00:39:18,001 --> 00:39:19,601
Why are you joining in too?

605
00:39:20,993 --> 00:39:22,201
Hey,

606
00:39:23,285 --> 00:39:26,193
what if Mu Jin does something
to Seo Hyeon to get revenge?

607
00:39:26,368 --> 00:39:27,368
Honey.

608
00:39:29,068 --> 00:39:30,901
This won't do, Jeong Woo. Don't listen.

609
00:39:31,335 --> 00:39:35,476
He gets like a child
whenever it's about Seo Hyeon.

610
00:39:35,501 --> 00:39:37,801
That's why I don't want a daughter.

611
00:39:43,488 --> 00:39:47,035
Please give Mu Jin one more chance.

612
00:39:47,635 --> 00:39:50,082
You have to give him that much,

613
00:39:50,468 --> 00:39:56,005
so he can reflect more deeply
and settle his debts.

614
00:40:55,668 --> 00:40:57,835
Yes, I'm making ox knee soup right now.

615
00:40:58,068 --> 00:41:00,235
I'll drop it off on my way to work.

616
00:41:00,828 --> 00:41:01,861
All right.

617
00:41:02,568 --> 00:41:05,461
- Is Heung Sik all right?
- Yes, he's fine.

618
00:41:06,349 --> 00:41:09,334
Yes. See you later, Gyu O.

619
00:41:09,889 --> 00:41:11,420
All right.

620
00:41:21,935 --> 00:41:24,131
That freeloader has found me out.

621
00:41:25,201 --> 00:41:26,838
So now he's blackmailing me.

622
00:41:27,017 --> 00:41:30,284
If I don't do as he says, he'll tell
Seong Uk everything.

623
00:41:32,201 --> 00:41:33,268
What are you going to do?

624
00:41:33,801 --> 00:41:36,168
What will you do if that freeloader
wrecks my marriage?

625
00:41:37,941 --> 00:41:40,985
- Have you seen him freeload?
- What?

626
00:41:41,167 --> 00:41:43,125
Why do you keep calling him that?

627
00:41:43,301 --> 00:41:45,401
Do you want to be sued for defamation?

628
00:41:46,135 --> 00:41:47,935
Are you taking that freeloader's side?

629
00:41:47,935 --> 00:41:49,435
There it is again.

630
00:41:51,035 --> 00:41:52,635
Say it one more time.

631
00:41:53,075 --> 00:41:54,912
Why? Are you going to hit me with that?

632
00:41:55,007 --> 00:41:57,218
You'd hit me for calling him a freeloader?

633
00:41:59,668 --> 00:42:00,968
Have you lost your mind?

634
00:42:01,035 --> 00:42:02,601
For calling him a freeloader...

635
00:42:05,468 --> 00:42:07,568
Don't talk about Heung Sik that way.

636
00:42:07,568 --> 00:42:09,668
Call him that one more time,

637
00:42:09,668 --> 00:42:11,801
and I'll go wreck your marriage myself.

638
00:42:12,068 --> 00:42:13,135
You and that freeloader...

639
00:42:13,368 --> 00:42:15,001
What's going on with Cho Heung Sik?

640
00:42:15,026 --> 00:42:17,301
So what? What business is it of yours?

641
00:42:18,981 --> 00:42:21,682
- Are you dating?
- Yes, we are.

642
00:42:22,568 --> 00:42:24,012
Since when?

643
00:42:24,597 --> 00:42:27,057
- Since now.
- What?

644
00:42:27,615 --> 00:42:30,266
This won't do.

645
00:42:46,327 --> 00:42:47,731
You're awake?

646
00:42:53,134 --> 00:42:54,366
Let's sit you up.

647
00:42:56,047 --> 00:42:57,047
One moment.

648
00:43:01,835 --> 00:43:02,901
Isn't it uncomfortable?

649
00:43:03,268 --> 00:43:04,468
Shall I get you another cushion?

650
00:43:06,461 --> 00:43:09,921
- Some water.
- Yes.

651
00:43:33,401 --> 00:43:34,733
Why did you do it?

652
00:43:38,168 --> 00:43:40,797
All I could think was
that I had to stop you.

653
00:43:41,568 --> 00:43:43,701
I forgot about the squid allergy.

654
00:43:44,007 --> 00:43:46,269
That's not something you forget.

655
00:43:46,935 --> 00:43:48,834
You could have died.

656
00:43:49,801 --> 00:43:51,328
I didn't, did I?

657
00:43:55,368 --> 00:43:56,801
Don't you think about your parents?

658
00:43:58,146 --> 00:44:00,920
Do you know how worried
your father and mother were?

659
00:44:02,235 --> 00:44:03,901
Dad started it.

660
00:44:04,468 --> 00:44:06,880
He fed you spicy food on purpose,

661
00:44:06,968 --> 00:44:09,368
to get back at you. He started it.

662
00:44:09,807 --> 00:44:10,807
You...

663
00:44:12,501 --> 00:44:14,260
Am I all you can see?

664
00:44:14,668 --> 00:44:16,435
Is there no room in your head
for your parents,

665
00:44:17,035 --> 00:44:18,619
nothing but Kim Mu Jin?

666
00:44:22,368 --> 00:44:24,368
You're thinking I'm pathetic, aren't you?

667
00:44:26,801 --> 00:44:28,435
I'm not the only strange one.

668
00:44:29,320 --> 00:44:33,854
Some people went mad with love
and betrayed their own country.

669
00:44:34,024 --> 00:44:37,298
- Seo Hyeon.
- So rather than this,

670
00:44:38,128 --> 00:44:40,310
hurry up and work things out
with Han Gyu Rim,

671
00:44:40,435 --> 00:44:42,694
and marry her as fast as you can.

672
00:44:44,734 --> 00:44:46,990
She isn't married anyway, is she?

673
00:44:48,768 --> 00:44:51,082
So that I can't hold on to any hope,

674
00:44:51,301 --> 00:44:53,750
so there's not a single gap
left for me to aim at,

675
00:44:55,468 --> 00:44:58,042
just go and do something about it.

676
00:45:07,401 --> 00:45:09,101
His name is Han Gyeol.

677
00:45:09,987 --> 00:45:12,062
Byeolha Elementary School,
first grade, class two.

678
00:45:12,868 --> 00:45:15,607
His mother is Han Gyu Rim, unmarried.

679
00:45:16,561 --> 00:45:21,843
Excellent grades, bright,
and gifted in the arts and sports too.

680
00:45:21,868 --> 00:45:23,001
When did you get all of this...

681
00:45:23,914 --> 00:45:25,880
Did you have Secretary Ahn look into it?

682
00:45:26,935 --> 00:45:29,501
You find out the rest yourself.

683
00:45:38,001 --> 00:45:40,453
- So what will you do?
- What do you mean?

684
00:45:41,601 --> 00:45:43,568
If this boy really is Mu Jin's son,

685
00:45:43,568 --> 00:45:44,935
what are you going to do?

686
00:45:47,516 --> 00:45:51,708
If he's as bright and promising
as Secretary Ahn reports,

687
00:45:53,228 --> 00:45:55,169
we bring him home and raise him properly.

688
00:45:56,935 --> 00:45:59,534
Would Han Gyu Rim hand him over
that easily?

689
00:46:00,801 --> 00:46:04,246
Whether she hands him over or not
isn't hers to decide.

690
00:46:04,695 --> 00:46:06,465
It's mine.

691
00:46:13,335 --> 00:46:14,835
Are you going to the noodle place?

692
00:46:15,368 --> 00:46:17,281
You said you wouldn't go for a while.

693
00:46:17,368 --> 00:46:19,047
I go when I feel like eating.

694
00:46:19,648 --> 00:46:21,314
What if you run into him?

695
00:46:21,501 --> 00:46:23,935
That's why I'm going
when there's no one there.

696
00:46:24,101 --> 00:46:26,068
It isn't as if he works there.

697
00:46:26,068 --> 00:46:28,000
What are the odds of meeting him again?

698
00:46:47,019 --> 00:46:48,635
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

699
00:46:50,225 --> 00:46:52,235
What do I do?

700
00:46:53,135 --> 00:46:54,268
Are you hurt?

701
00:46:54,293 --> 00:46:56,801
Does this look all right to you?

702
00:46:57,235 --> 00:46:58,901
What about my shoes?

703
00:46:59,135 --> 00:47:00,435
What are you going to do about this?

704
00:47:00,701 --> 00:47:02,401
- I'll compensate you.
- Compensate?

705
00:47:02,401 --> 00:47:03,801
Sweetheart, what's going on?

706
00:47:03,876 --> 00:47:08,100
- Are you hurt?
- Baby, it hurts to walk.

707
00:47:08,201 --> 00:47:11,001
This woman stepped on my shoe,

708
00:47:11,001 --> 00:47:13,001
and the whole thing came off.

709
00:47:14,135 --> 00:47:16,193
I said I'd compensate you for it.

710
00:47:16,441 --> 00:47:20,601
Do you think this is something
they sell at a market stall?

711
00:47:20,601 --> 00:47:24,201
My boyfriend bought this for me
on a business trip to Italy.

712
00:47:24,226 --> 00:47:27,835
Someone like you is in no position
to compensate for it.

713
00:47:28,501 --> 00:47:30,828
That's why I said I would. How much is it?

714
00:47:30,968 --> 00:47:34,103
Who are you speaking to like that?

715
00:47:34,268 --> 00:47:37,176
- You spoke to me that way first.
- When?

716
00:47:37,201 --> 00:47:40,230
I may look young, but I'm older than you.

717
00:47:40,255 --> 00:47:43,014
Watch your mouth.

718
00:47:43,468 --> 00:47:46,632
If you can't afford it,
stay at home where you belong.

719
00:47:46,835 --> 00:47:49,242
So what if you're older? Is that a title?

720
00:47:49,474 --> 00:47:51,256
Yes, it is.

721
00:47:52,035 --> 00:47:53,068
And what is this now?

722
00:47:53,114 --> 00:47:56,122
Watching youngsters behave so rudely,

723
00:47:56,147 --> 00:47:58,227
I can't sit quietly and eat my noodles.

724
00:47:58,301 --> 00:48:00,510
- Who are you?
- I just told you.

725
00:48:00,535 --> 00:48:02,668
I was the guy eating noodles over there.

726
00:48:02,867 --> 00:48:04,335
One moment.

727
00:48:04,835 --> 00:48:06,468
How much should I pay you?

728
00:48:06,468 --> 00:48:08,547
- Give me your account number.
- Hand it over.

729
00:48:08,914 --> 00:48:11,997
- Honestly.
- This man has lost his mind.

730
00:48:12,080 --> 00:48:13,093
Fifty dollars.

731
00:48:13,473 --> 00:48:16,272
Fifty dollars at the very most
should cover it.

732
00:48:16,649 --> 00:48:17,765
Shall I lend it to you?

733
00:48:17,790 --> 00:48:19,081
- Hey!
- Sir!

734
00:48:19,928 --> 00:48:22,807
Making all this fuss over a knockoff?

735
00:48:22,832 --> 00:48:23,872
Sir.

736
00:48:24,261 --> 00:48:27,594
Look at you, scrawny as an anchovy.

737
00:48:27,713 --> 00:48:31,566
What would someone like you
know about designer goods?

738
00:48:31,711 --> 00:48:36,577
I know. I used to make and sell these,
so I can spot one a mile off.

739
00:48:37,939 --> 00:48:40,927
Shall I tell you that the bag
she's holding is a knockoff too?

740
00:48:41,479 --> 00:48:44,603
Baby, what does he mean? Is this a fake?

741
00:48:44,628 --> 00:48:46,829
This lunatic! Will you be quiet?

742
00:48:46,854 --> 00:48:50,859
Who do you think you are, butting in
and talking about designer goods?

743
00:48:50,884 --> 00:48:53,280
Sir, please call the police.

744
00:48:53,305 --> 00:48:54,730
What are you staring at?

745
00:48:54,755 --> 00:48:56,816
- About 40 dollars should do it.
- Ridiculous. Be quiet!

746
00:48:56,841 --> 00:48:58,478
- Let go.
- Stay out of it.

747
00:48:58,503 --> 00:48:59,725
Goodbye.

748
00:48:59,750 --> 00:49:02,629
(Danimgil Noodles)

749
00:49:06,260 --> 00:49:07,640
Are you all right?

750
00:49:08,934 --> 00:49:11,050
So it really was a knockoff.

751
00:49:12,654 --> 00:49:14,864
You didn't know it was fake?

752
00:49:14,889 --> 00:49:16,503
How would I know that?

753
00:49:16,933 --> 00:49:19,522
I just said it to save you,

754
00:49:19,770 --> 00:49:21,694
and he walked right into it.

755
00:49:22,920 --> 00:49:25,073
It must have been hard
facing them one on one.

756
00:49:25,920 --> 00:49:29,013
Well, it's over safely.
That's what matters.

757
00:49:32,473 --> 00:49:35,567
This has gone cold.
Order yourself a fresh one.

758
00:49:36,234 --> 00:49:37,300
It's all right.

759
00:49:38,027 --> 00:49:40,691
- Shall I order for you?
- No, it's fine.

760
00:50:26,938 --> 00:50:28,791
(Kwon Hui Na)

761
00:50:37,634 --> 00:50:38,888
Guys, is anything missing,

762
00:50:38,889 --> 00:50:40,694
- or left behind?
- No.

763
00:50:40,695 --> 00:50:43,542
Let's check once more
before we leave the classroom.

764
00:50:43,634 --> 00:50:47,367
Notebook, water bottle, hat.

765
00:50:57,030 --> 00:51:01,597
(That gigolo)

766
00:51:24,820 --> 00:51:28,360
Call one more time
and I'm reporting you to the police.

767
00:51:36,647 --> 00:51:39,379
The number you have dialed is unavailable.
Please leave a message after the tone.

768
00:51:39,403 --> 00:51:41,660
Charges will apply.

769
00:51:42,530 --> 00:51:45,993
Kwon Hui Na, it's Han Gyu O.

770
00:51:47,596 --> 00:51:49,900
Did you know this number was mine?
Is that why you won't answer?

771
00:51:51,268 --> 00:51:52,467
Do you dislike me that much?

772
00:51:53,734 --> 00:51:55,107
Even if you do, see me just once.

773
00:51:57,387 --> 00:51:58,853
Just once, let's meet.

774
00:52:00,407 --> 00:52:04,396
No messing about or shouting
when we cross the main road.

775
00:52:04,421 --> 00:52:05,694
Yes.

776
00:52:05,719 --> 00:52:09,715
Even on a green light, you check
for cars and motorbikes. Understood?

777
00:52:09,740 --> 00:52:11,254
Yes.

778
00:52:17,596 --> 00:52:18,802
(That gigolo)

779
00:52:18,827 --> 00:52:20,658
(You have a new voice message.)

780
00:52:20,683 --> 00:52:23,751
Why is this bird leaving voice messages?

781
00:52:28,653 --> 00:52:31,855
Sorry, guys. A bird suddenly flew by.

782
00:52:32,532 --> 00:52:34,267
There goes a bird.

783
00:52:35,381 --> 00:52:36,859
What kind of bird is it?

784
00:53:11,987 --> 00:53:14,754
Yes, Gyu Rim. I'm at Gyeol's school.

785
00:53:15,919 --> 00:53:17,493
I just got here.

786
00:53:19,967 --> 00:53:22,372
Heung Sik's friend came
to look after him for a bit.

787
00:53:27,503 --> 00:53:29,762
That's my uncle.

788
00:53:30,417 --> 00:53:32,205
- Gyeol's uncle is here?
- Yes.

789
00:53:32,373 --> 00:53:33,945
Today I have a dentist appointment,

790
00:53:33,970 --> 00:53:36,699
but Su Nam is away, so my mom is busy.

791
00:53:36,908 --> 00:53:38,821
So my uncle said he'd come instead.

792
00:53:39,192 --> 00:53:41,355
I see. I should go and say hello.

793
00:53:46,101 --> 00:53:49,312
All right. I'll get him there safely.
Please don't worry.

794
00:53:50,117 --> 00:53:51,217
Yes.

795
00:53:52,589 --> 00:53:54,294
All right.

796
00:53:55,629 --> 00:53:57,920
Gyeol's out. I'll hang up.

797
00:54:01,774 --> 00:54:03,060
How is it? Any better?

798
00:54:03,286 --> 00:54:04,999
No, it stings.

799
00:54:05,580 --> 00:54:08,035
Something must have got in your eye.

800
00:54:08,901 --> 00:54:11,348
Shall we put in some drops
and go to the nurse?

801
00:54:14,687 --> 00:54:16,814
Ms. Hui Na, take Jin Ju to the nurse.

802
00:54:16,839 --> 00:54:19,065
I'll take them across.

803
00:54:19,167 --> 00:54:20,932
- Could you do that?
- Yes.

804
00:54:22,439 --> 00:54:24,308
The light has changed.

805
00:54:24,481 --> 00:54:26,691
I'm going now. Come on, everyone.

806
00:54:26,716 --> 00:54:28,249
Yes. Cross carefully.

807
00:54:35,206 --> 00:54:37,394
Ms. Hui Na, it hurts.

808
00:54:37,550 --> 00:54:39,106
What do we do?

809
00:54:44,279 --> 00:54:45,980
This is my uncle.

810
00:54:46,476 --> 00:54:48,254
Hello.

811
00:54:48,613 --> 00:54:49,633
Hello.

812
00:54:49,941 --> 00:54:53,016
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

813
00:54:53,267 --> 00:54:55,782
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

814
00:55:05,510 --> 00:55:08,867
- Is that your teacher?
- Yes.

815
00:55:08,974 --> 00:55:10,754
- What's her name?
- Why?

816
00:55:10,779 --> 00:55:12,759
No reason. She seems familiar.

817
00:55:12,784 --> 00:55:14,558
What does familiar mean?

818
00:55:15,520 --> 00:55:17,649
She looks like someone I know.

819
00:55:17,674 --> 00:55:21,073
Someone you know? Who does she look like?

820
00:55:23,741 --> 00:55:26,614
Sorry, I shouldn't have asked. Let's go.

821
00:55:26,639 --> 00:55:30,503
My teacher's name...

822
00:55:32,254 --> 00:55:34,380
I'm not telling you.

823
00:55:34,921 --> 00:55:35,945
Why not?

824
00:55:35,948 --> 00:55:39,401
My teacher is exactly your type.

825
00:55:39,507 --> 00:55:44,240
But I don't want you to like my teacher.

826
00:55:45,521 --> 00:55:46,567
Why not?

827
00:55:46,801 --> 00:55:49,954
Because you're my uncle
and she's my teacher.

828
00:55:52,660 --> 00:55:55,620
You don't want school and family
getting tangled up?

829
00:55:56,335 --> 00:55:58,974
I understand what you're saying.
Don't worry.

830
00:55:58,999 --> 00:56:00,446
It won't happen.

831
00:56:02,605 --> 00:56:04,554
There's someone else I like.

832
00:56:05,781 --> 00:56:07,561
Hold my hand. Let's go.

833
00:56:19,274 --> 00:56:20,374
Dad.

834
00:56:21,578 --> 00:56:23,432
What brings you here?

835
00:56:24,892 --> 00:56:26,494
Isn't this your shop?

836
00:56:27,381 --> 00:56:29,661
I locked up and left.

837
00:56:30,307 --> 00:56:31,334
How?

838
00:56:33,414 --> 00:56:35,705
Su Nam is back.

839
00:56:39,614 --> 00:56:41,907
- Gyu Rim.
- Yes?

840
00:56:43,346 --> 00:56:47,693
I want you to meet the finest man
in the world.

841
00:56:47,867 --> 00:56:49,193
That's all it is.

842
00:56:49,988 --> 00:56:52,314
Nobody put me up to it.

843
00:56:53,174 --> 00:56:55,526
What do you mean, out of nowhere?

844
00:56:55,924 --> 00:56:57,729
Yes. All right.

845
00:57:08,059 --> 00:57:11,148
- Did the trip go all right?
- Yes.

846
00:57:17,088 --> 00:57:19,614
Did your friend pass away?

847
00:57:20,078 --> 00:57:21,647
She's all right.

848
00:57:21,668 --> 00:57:23,814
That's why I came back like this.

849
00:57:25,887 --> 00:57:28,280
Then why are you crying, Su Nam?

850
00:57:31,608 --> 00:57:33,329
That friend of mine,

851
00:57:33,896 --> 00:57:37,231
even as she struggled to breathe,

852
00:57:37,479 --> 00:57:40,143
she kept saying she had to see,

853
00:57:40,357 --> 00:57:43,000
at least one of her three sons married,

854
00:57:43,025 --> 00:57:45,660
clinging to her senses for dear life,

855
00:57:46,348 --> 00:57:48,074
it really hit close to home.

856
00:57:48,861 --> 00:57:51,732
So on the way up from Jindo,

857
00:57:52,194 --> 00:57:56,298
I made up my mind to hold on to you,

858
00:57:56,458 --> 00:57:58,789
and beg you if I had to.

859
00:58:02,497 --> 00:58:08,010
Heung Sik isn't well educated,

860
00:58:08,202 --> 00:58:11,669
and he isn't especially gifted either,

861
00:58:11,778 --> 00:58:15,014
but he's kind and steady,

862
00:58:15,521 --> 00:58:20,855
and above all, he cherishes and loves
you and Gyeol more than anything.

863
00:58:21,963 --> 00:58:26,714
So I was going to ask you
to give Heung Sik a chance.

864
00:58:30,588 --> 00:58:33,315
What did my father say to you?

865
00:58:37,907 --> 00:58:40,314
He told me to step aside.

866
00:58:40,841 --> 00:58:43,160
He said Gyeol's father had come back,

867
00:58:44,574 --> 00:58:47,614
and that you'd be working
things out with him,

868
00:58:47,782 --> 00:58:51,474
so Heung Sik should step aside.

869
00:58:51,627 --> 00:58:52,915
What?

870
00:58:54,448 --> 00:58:57,820
Then stepping aside is the right thing.

871
00:58:59,107 --> 00:59:01,587
What can I do if Gyeol's father is back?

872
00:59:02,280 --> 00:59:06,320
Heung Sik should step aside
a hundred times over.

873
00:59:07,627 --> 00:59:10,093
I don't know why these pointless tears,

874
00:59:10,684 --> 00:59:13,280
keep coming, I really don't.

875
00:59:31,427 --> 00:59:33,287
Could we talk for a moment?

876
00:59:53,674 --> 00:59:56,400
I'd rather you stopped coming
to see Seo Hyeon.

877
00:59:59,020 --> 01:00:00,053
Sorry?

878
01:00:01,660 --> 01:00:05,513
What happened yesterday
wasn't your fault, Mu Jin.

879
01:00:07,341 --> 01:00:10,728
I mean you don't have to come
out of guilt or obligation.

880
01:00:12,653 --> 01:00:14,373
That isn't why I come.

881
01:00:15,801 --> 01:00:16,801
Then why?

882
01:00:19,687 --> 01:00:23,913
It may be nothing more than kindness
and warmth to you,

883
01:00:24,348 --> 01:00:28,014
but when Seo Hyeon sees you come,

884
01:00:28,221 --> 01:00:30,200
she can't help but hope.

885
01:00:31,554 --> 01:00:35,043
She's fooled and disappointed
and mistaken every time,

886
01:00:35,831 --> 01:00:38,747
and she keeps holding on to futile hope.

887
01:00:42,955 --> 01:00:44,627
Let's stop now.

888
01:00:45,960 --> 01:00:48,860
You shouldn't do this,
at least for Seo Hyeon's sake.

889
01:00:50,961 --> 01:00:53,054
Let's end it here, Mu Jin.

890
01:00:53,627 --> 01:00:55,593
I'm asking you.

891
01:01:09,994 --> 01:01:11,801
Don't wait for Mu Jin.

892
01:01:12,067 --> 01:01:13,407
He won't be coming anymore.

893
01:01:14,488 --> 01:01:16,005
Mom.

894
01:01:17,234 --> 01:01:22,108
You were the one
ready to emigrate over this.

895
01:01:25,238 --> 01:01:26,764
Let it go now.

896
01:01:27,244 --> 01:01:29,244
Mu Jin isn't the one for you.

897
01:01:41,060 --> 01:01:42,289
Mu Jin.

898
01:01:43,001 --> 01:01:44,314
Mu Jin.

899
01:01:45,574 --> 01:01:47,381
Let me take over, ma'am.

900
01:01:51,050 --> 01:01:57,987
I won't disappoint, hurt,
or confuse Seo Hyeon anymore.

901
01:01:58,947 --> 01:02:00,594
Mu Jin.

902
01:02:02,430 --> 01:02:06,601
So from now on,
let's date each other properly.

903
01:02:09,074 --> 01:02:11,899
Are you proposing to me right now?

904
01:02:14,859 --> 01:02:19,021
Yes. I'm proposing to you right now.

905
01:02:19,046 --> 01:02:22,109
Have you lost your mind?
Did you eat something bad?

906
01:02:22,134 --> 01:02:23,838
Are you drunk?

907
01:02:23,900 --> 01:02:27,680
Because you know my whole story.

908
01:02:28,134 --> 01:02:31,034
You know exactly how second-rate
and lacking I am.

909
01:02:32,683 --> 01:02:34,247
You know all of it.

910
01:02:36,147 --> 01:02:38,548
If you're truly all right
with someone like me,

911
01:02:39,754 --> 01:02:43,296
let's see each other seriously.

912
01:02:57,650 --> 01:03:00,613
Not as friends, but as a man and a woman.

913
01:03:00,900 --> 01:03:02,607
Let's see each other properly, Seo Hyeon.

914
01:03:40,897 --> 01:03:43,222
(Love on the Menu)

915
01:03:43,247 --> 01:03:45,633
This man is my boyfriend.

916
01:03:45,674 --> 01:03:47,028
I heard you two are dating?

917
01:03:47,065 --> 01:03:49,640
You ended things properly
with Han Gyu Rim, didn't you?

918
01:03:49,665 --> 01:03:51,611
May I date Gyu Rim?

919
01:03:51,636 --> 01:03:55,514
Whether you might start over with Gyu Rim.

920
01:03:55,539 --> 01:03:58,382
When did I ever start
anything with Gyu Rim?

921
01:03:58,407 --> 01:04:00,420
Are you waiting on a call?

922
01:04:00,581 --> 01:04:03,321
I left a voice message
and I think it was ignored.

923
01:04:03,346 --> 01:04:05,072
Gyu O, is the girl you're after
Kwon Hui Na?

924
01:04:05,093 --> 01:04:06,294
Where are you now?

925
01:04:06,319 --> 01:04:08,701
Gyu Yeong, let's prepare
one more crocodile bag.

926
01:04:08,726 --> 01:04:12,487
How large a credit line
could I get, by any chance?

927
01:04:12,641 --> 01:04:17,234
No. Once I'm married,
I can pay it right back.

928
01:04:17,259 --> 01:04:20,607
My in-laws are seriously rich.

929
01:04:20,632 --> 01:04:23,985
I'm going to have to stop your wedding.

930
01:04:24,736 --> 01:04:26,636
Dramaday.me
